# The headless-browser seam's scratch: the Chrome profile AND the spawned service's
# data root. Under the worktree, never `/tmp` (AGENTS.md §Host hygiene), and never
# committed. `tests/helpers/browser.ts` deletes each profile when it kills the browser.
/.browser-scratch/

# The slice-17 storage pins' scratch (`tests/concurrency.test.ts`, `tests/sqlite-core.test.ts`):
# the legacy data roots the boot import reads, and the data roots two CHILD PROCESSES
# write to / are SIGKILLed against. Under the worktree, never `/tmp`, and deleted by the
# tests' own `afterAll`.
/.sqlite-scratch/

# The data root lives OUTSIDE the repo (ledger row 13). These are the preventive
# half of PIN S6; the tripwire in tests/secrets.test.ts is the enforcing half.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
